    </div>
    <div class="auto-faq">
        <div class="item is-open"><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">01</span><h3 class="qt">Which automotive quality standards do you run to?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Automotive lines run to IATF 16949, with PPAP and APQP discipline. Parts are qualified to the relevant AEC-Q stress qualifications for the device type.</p></div></div>
        <div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">02</span><h3 class="qt">Can a program move between your plants?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Yes. Automotive processes are qualified across China, Thailand, Cambodia and the USA. Where a transfer is required for capacity or supply continuity, the program follows a documented qualification process at the receiving site.</p></div></div>
        <div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">03</span><h3 class="qt">Do you support us from design, or only build to print?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Hana can support programs from DFM through production. Design-for-manufacturing review is carried out before NPI so manufacturing issues can be addressed before the product reaches the line.</p></div></div>
        <div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">04</span><h3 class="qt">What level of traceability do you provide?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Material, unit and product traceability is captured through production, allowing field and quality questions to be traced back to the relevant board, material lot and production shift.</p></div></div>
        <div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">05</span><h3 class="qt">How do we start a conversation?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Tell us what the part does in the vehicle and your target volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site, process route and next steps for the program.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- closing CTA -->
  <div style="margin-top:40px;">
    <section class="auto-cta auto-cta--hub" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="none">
      <div class="inner">
        <div>
          <h2>Have an automotive program in mind?</h2>
          <p>Tell us what the part does in the vehicle and your target volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site and process route for your program.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="/contact" class="auto-btn auto-btn--ondark-primary">Start a program <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</div>

